    [19100]={name="Electrified Dagger",quality=3,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Gaelden Hammersmith.",zone="Alterac Valley",npc="Gaelden Hammersmith",proc="Chance on hit: Blasts a target for 45 Nature damage."},
    [19106]={name="Ice Barbed Spear",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Legend of Korrak'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: According to legend, the leader of the mighty Winterax trolls appears at will to wreak havoc on the denizens of Alterac Valley.Should Korrak make himself known, destroy him and return to Warmaster Laggrond.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="The Legend of Korrak",lore="The invading Stormpike are not the only threat in the region, soldier. The war in the Valley is waged on two fronts. The cannibal Winterax trolls also vie for power."},
    [19107]={name="Bloodseeker",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Legend of Korrak'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: According to legend, the leader of the mighty Winterax trolls appears at will to wreak havoc on the denizens of Alterac Valley.Should Korrak make himself known, destroy him and return to Warmaster Laggrond.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="The Legend of Korrak",lore="The invading Stormpike are not the only threat in the region, soldier. The war in the Valley is waged on two fronts. The cannibal Winterax trolls also vie for power."},
    [19109]={name="Deep Rooted Ring",quality=3,ilvl=63,reqLevel=58,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ivus the Forest Lord.",zone="Alterac Valley",npc="Ivus the Forest Lord"},
    [19114]={name="Highland Bow",quality=2,ilvl=51,reqLevel=46,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Primal Torntusk'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Return to Primal Torntusk",lore="Return to my mate, Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village. Tell her that I am coming home! She is sure to reward you."},
    [19120]={name="Rune of the Guard Captain",quality=2,ilvl=51,reqLevel=46,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Job Opening: Guard Captain of Revantusk Village'. The quest is in The Hinterlands. Objective: You have been tasked with the decimation of 20 Vilebranch Berserkers, 20 Vilebranch Shadow Hunters, 20 Vilebranch Blood Drinkers, and 20 Vilebranch Soul Eaters.Should you complete this task, return to Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Job Opening: Guard Captain of Revantusk Village",lore="With the loss of Guard Captain Malkhor, the position of Guard Captain of Revantusk is once again open.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 0.7%."},
    [19125]={name="Seared Mail Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=49,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fiery Menace!'. Starts with Hansel Heavyhands in Searing Gorge. Objective: Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Greater Lava Spiders in the Searing Gorge. You can find Greater Lava Spiders in the plateaus and lava pools of the Searing Gorge.Return to Hansel Heavyhands in the Searing Gorge when you have killed enough Greater Lava Spiders.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Fiery Menace!",lore="Wouldn't ye know it, every time ol' Hansel wants to take a moment to relax and reflect upon his life, the powers that be give him another job."},
    [19127]={name="Charred Leather Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'WANTED: Overseer Maltorius'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Searing Gorge. Objective: Deep within the Slag Pit of the Cauldron, in the Searing Gorge, you will find the traitorous Dark Iron dwarf named Overseer Maltorius.Slay Overseer Maltorius and take his head. Return the head to Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker in the Searing Gorge for your reward.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="WANTED: Overseer Maltorius",lore="By order o' 'is eminence, Overseer Oilfist, the rogue Thorium Brotherhood agent an' newly hired commander o' the Dark Iron Slag Pit crew o' the Cauldron, Overseer Maltorius, is to be killed an' 'is head brung back as proof o' the deed."},
    [19128]={name="Seared Mail Vest",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'WANTED: Overseer Maltorius'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Searing Gorge. Objective: Deep within the Slag Pit of the Cauldron, in the Searing Gorge, you will find the traitorous Dark Iron dwarf named Overseer Maltorius.Slay Overseer Maltorius and take his head. Return the head to Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker in the Searing Gorge for your reward.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="WANTED: Overseer Maltorius",lore="By order o' 'is eminence, Overseer Oilfist, the rogue Thorium Brotherhood agent an' newly hired commander o' the Dark Iron Slag Pit crew o' the Cauldron, Overseer Maltorius, is to be killed an' 'is head brung back as proof o' the deed."},
    [19138]={name="Band of Sulfuras",quality=4,ilvl=78,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ragnaros.",npc="Ragnaros",lore="The Firelord, one of the four Elemental Lords, bound to the Elemental Plane until the Dark Iron dwarves summoned him under Blackrock Mountain. The summoning cracked the mountain open and made the Molten Core."},
    [19159]={name="Woven Ivy Necklace",quality=3,ilvl=51,reqLevel=46,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wanted: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in The Hinterlands. Objective: You have been ordered to slay Vile Priestess Hexx and 20 Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guards. See Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands once this task is complete.Vile Priestess Hexx and the Aman'zasi Guards can be found atop Jintha'alor in the Hinterlands.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Wanted: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions",lore="By order of Primal Torntusk, Vile Priestess Hexx and her minions are to be brought to justice! A grand reward is offered for any that slay the Vile Priestess Hexx and all of her Aman'zasi elite guard."},
    [19163]={name="Molten Belt",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [19167]={name="Blackfury",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike by 1.0%."},
    [19169]={name="Nightfall",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing",proc="Chance on hit: Spell damage taken by target increased by 15% for 5 sec."},
    [19302]={name="Darkmoon Ring",quality=3,ilvl=55,reqLevel=50,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Lhara.",zone="Goldshire",npc="Lhara"},
    [19303]={name="Darkmoon Necklace",quality=3,ilvl=55,reqLevel=50,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Lhara.",zone="Goldshire",npc="Lhara"},
    [19371]={name="Pendant of the Fallen Dragon",quality=4,ilvl=74,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Vaelastrasz the Corrupt.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Vaelastrasz the Corrupt",lore="A red dragon of Alexstrasza's flight, broken by Nefarian's experiments. He asks to be killed before the corruption finishes taking him, and apologises while he fights."},
    [19376]={name="Archimtiros' Ring of Reckoning",quality=4,ilvl=83,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Nefarian.",npc="Nefarian",lore="Deathwing's son, working under Blackrock Mountain to breed the chromatic flight -- dragons carrying the blood of all five. He spent years in Stormwind's court as Lord Victor Nefarius while the work went on."},
    [19377]={name="Prestor's Talisman of Connivery",quality=4,ilvl=83,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Nefarian.",npc="Nefarian",lore="Deathwing's son, working under Blackrock Mountain to breed the chromatic flight -- dragons carrying the blood of all five. He spent years in Stormwind's court as Lord Victor Nefarius while the work went on.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%."},
    [19383]={name="Master Dragonslayer's Medallion",quality=4,ilvl=83,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Lord of Blackrock'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind City. Objective: Venture to the Valley of Heroes in Stormwind City and speak with Field Marshal Afrasiabi.",zone="Stormwind City",questName="The Lord of Blackrock"},
    [19384]={name="Master Dragonslayer's Ring",quality=4,ilvl=83,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Lord of Blackrock'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind City. Objective: Venture to the Valley of Heroes in Stormwind City and speak with Field Marshal Afrasiabi.",zone="Stormwind City",questName="The Lord of Blackrock",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%."},
    [19399]={name="Black Ash Robe",quality=4,ilvl=75,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Firemaw.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Firemaw",lore="One of Nefarian's three guardian drakes, holding the suspended walkways above the lair floor."},
    [19406]={name="Drake Fang Talisman",quality=4,ilvl=75,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ebonroc.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Ebonroc",lore="Cut from the fang of one of Nefarian's drakes. Tanks wore it for the stun it shrugs off, not the numbers on it.",proc="Equip: Increases your chance to Dodge an attack by 1.0%."},
    [19431]={name="Styleen's Impeding Scarab",quality=4,ilvl=75,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Flamegor.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Flamegor",lore="The last of Nefarian's three drakes, and the one that simply gets angrier as the fight goes on.",proc="Equip: Increases your chance to Block attacks with a shield by 5.0%."},
    [19432]={name="Circle of Applied Force",quality=4,ilvl=75,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Flamegor.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Flamegor",lore="The last of Nefarian's three drakes, and the one that simply gets angrier as the fight goes on."},
    [19491]={name="Amulet of the Darkmoon",quality=4,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest '1200 Tickets - Amulet of the Darkmoon'. Starts with Gelvas Grimegate in Mulgore. Objective: ProgressStep right up, step right up! &nbsp;If you have tickets from the Darkmoon Faire you'd like redeemed, then just say so! &nbsp;You can redeem tickets in various denominations for wondrous and fantastic prizes. &nbsp;Don't be shy, give it a try!",zone="Mulgore",questName="1200 Tickets - Amulet of the Darkmoon"},
