    [22436]={name="Cryptstalker Tunic",quality=4,ilvl=92,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cryptstalker Tunic'. Starts with Huntsman Leopold in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Cryptstalker Tunic if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Cryptstalker Tunic",lore="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.",proc="Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%."},
