    [22668]={name="Bracers of Subterfuge",quality=4,ilvl=60,reqLevel=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: For 110 Insignias of the Dawn and 110 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn",lore="Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power? I must warn you; purchases made at a friendly reputation with the Dawn come with an extremely hefty surcharge."},
